  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}什、什么！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_302.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}这里似乎是一条让邂逅命定伴侣的\n恋人们倾诉爱意的道路。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_302.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
